# Toy castle tower (ticket 27.7): a round corner tower of cylinder blocks, origin on the middle of its foot at y = 0. Five 1 m blocks 2 m in radius, beech and
# cream in turn, carry the ring: a yellow plank disc 2.5 m in radius whose flat top at 5.3 m is the balcony the wall-walk (5 m) steps up onto. Two blocks 1.4 m in
# radius stand on the ring to 7.3 m, where the roof (toy_castle_roof_lilac or _mustard) is set. Four mint window blocks round the upper shaft.
